783327/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松井玲奈さん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂４６の兼任が解除されました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番思うのはやっぱり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいたら片想いでのシングルで私が初めて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜に入った時と同時に玲奈さんが兼任できてくださって..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂にもとてもいい風を吹かせてくださいました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでもこなす玲奈さんはやっぱり尊敬するとこばかりで..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやの名前もすぐに覚えてくれて嬉しかったなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲奈さんとハグした時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやにいつも癒されてたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってもらえました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったな(๑°꒵°๑)･*♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲奈さんは乃木坂の一ファンとしてライブとかにも駆けつけたい！応援してます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくださいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたし達も玲奈さんは乃木坂のfamilyだから、ずっと応援してます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もUNDER LIVE頑張ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった方は声が枯れそうなくらい盛り上げてくてて、これない方はブログや、755等で応援してくれて、本当に心強いし、毎日のパワーになってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜メンバーも沢山見に来てくれたり、\n昨日はクロちゃんさんや、アルコ&ピースさんも応援にきてくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クロちゃんさんはまあやの膝の使い方が好きと言ってくださってなんだか良くわかんないけどめちゃくちゃ嬉しかった(๑°꒵°๑)･*♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"膝使っていこうと思いますっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんは見に来てくれたその日に帰ってからも連絡をくれて、パフォーマンスとか褒めてくれました。（≧∇≦）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルコ&ピースさんもラジオでまあやの話をちょこっとしてくれたみたいでうれちっʕ·͡ˑ·ཻʔෆ⃛ʕ•̫͡•ོʔ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブはファンの方との距離が近いし、一体感が凄くあるから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーやスタッフさんはもちろん沢山の人と絆が深まるので、もっと頑張ろうー‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってパワーになります。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場の皆も倒れるんじゃないかと思うぐらいのパワーで、本当に凄い熱気だから、アンダーライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チケット外れた方も見てもらえるぐらいの大きな所で出来たらいいなぁ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地方とかでもやりたい～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日のライブでは、影ナレをさせてもらったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後半に向けて全力で皆と駆け抜けて行きたい‼️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで応援して下さい‼️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤングジャンプさん見てくれた！って方がいて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは、あみちゃんとかりんちゃんと何故か"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"科学部だよ～笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コップから白い煙が出てるの爆発しそうでしょ～笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影楽しかった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれドライアイスなんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"煙が出るのがすごく面白くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやが楽屋でも遊べるようにスタッフさんがドライアイスと水とコップで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影用じゃなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通にまあや用に作ってくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0033.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、乃木坂工事中始まるね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バナナマンさんと、スタッフさんとこれからも会えるのが凄く嬉しいし、画面をとおして乃木坂を知ってもらえるのは嬉しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも成長していく姿を見てもらえるように頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノギビンゴ次週はまあやも出させてもらったので、是非見てね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0034.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"疲労ハンパないけど洗濯物して明日の学校の準備して寝ます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0035.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/04/16/8783327/0036.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"par